ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nFeng Na plays with her doll in the garden. The sky suddenly starts to rain, her mother calls her to hurry home, she leaves the doll in the garden. While they eat lunch, Feng Na's mother asks Feng Na: \"Do you forget the doll in the garden?\" Feng Na says: \"No, I bring her in, mom.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Feng Na say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Feng Na forgets she doesn't bring the doll home because she never takes the doll out.\nB. Feng Na intentionally lies about bringing the doll home to cover up the fact that she loses the doll.\nC. Feng Na forgets she doesn't bring the doll home because she rushes home due to the sudden rain and forgets she doesn't bring the doll.\nD. Feng Na intentionally lies about bringing the doll home because she worries her mother is afraid to blame her.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001324975592004621,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5889d9aa9dc5a833d4b79","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794476189184,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:36:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"879d005270d44d1f9c0bc67c7255803c"}